 tourfixer:{status:'Live project',category:'Travel tech',image:'assets/projects/tourfixer.webp',alt:'Tourfixer’s real homepage showing private transfers and local guides across Uzbekistan.',caption:'A real look at tourfixer.uz',summary:'A more connected way to explore Uzbekistan.',idea:'Bring private transfers, local guides, and day trips into one place, so travelers can explore their options before a journey.',details:[['A journey starts somewhere','Routes between cities, airport transfers, and different vehicle options give the experience a practical starting point.'],['Local knowledge matters','The platform connects travelers with local guides in places including Samarkand, Bukhara, Khiva, and Tashkent.'],['Why it belongs in my world','Tourfixer sits right at the intersection of building digital products and my interest in travel tech.']],link:'https://tourfixer.uz',linkText:'Explore Tourfixer',tags:['Travel tech','Transfers','Local guides']},
